{"id":"44c45a33-eab5-4bb8-ba14-f517ce9eb4e7","object":"chat.completion","created":1785025249,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    sv = case['sentence_vectors']\\n    qv = case['query_vector']\\n    cw = case['context_weight']\\n    n = len(sv)\\n    sims = []\\n    q_norm = sum(x*x for x in qv)**0.5\\n    for v in sv:\\n        dot = sum(a*b for a,b in zip(v, qv))\\n        v_norm = sum(x*x for x in v)**0.5\\n        if q_norm == 0 or v_norm == 0:\\n            sims.append(0.0)\\n        else:\\n            sims.append(dot/(q_norm*v_norm))\\n    neighbor_avgs = []\\n    for i in range(n):\\n        neighbors = []\\n        if i-1 >= 0:\\n            neighbors.append(sims[i-1])\\n        if i+1 < n:\\n            neighbors.append(sims[i+1])\\n        if neighbors:\\n            neighbor_avgs.append(sum(neighbors)/len(neighbors))\\n        else:\\n            neighbor_avgs.append(0.0)\\n    final_scores = [(1-cw)*sims[i] + cw*neighbor_avgs[i] for i in range(n)]\\n    rounded = [round(s, 6) for s in final_scores]\\n    indexed = [(rounded[i], i) for i in range(n)]\\n    indexed.sort(key=lambda x: (-x[0], x[1]))\\n    ranking = [idx for _, idx in indexed]\\n    scores = [sc for sc, _ in indexed]\\n    return {'ranking': ranking, 'scores': scores}\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to solve NLP-CSE-01. From fixture payload, case has sentence_vectors (list of lists of ints), query_vector (list of ints), context_weight (float). Task: compute context-aware sentence scores. Steps:\n\n1. For each sentence vector, compute cosine similarity with query_vector. If either norm is zero, similarity = 0.\n2. For each position i, average the available immediate-neighbor similarities. \"Immediate-neighbor\" likely means previous and next, if exist. For first and last, only one neighbor? \"average the available immediate-neighbor similarities\" means for each i, take similarity of i, 